  "starterCode": "def solve(rankings,relevant,k):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(rankings,relevant,k):\n    return sum(bool(set(r[:k])&set(rel)) for r,rel in zip(rankings,relevant))/len(rankings) if rankings else 0.0\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
